<title>AUSTRIA: Wolford 96/97 prelim net up at 190 mln ats. [CORRECTED 09:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Wolford 96/97 prelim net up at 190 mln ats. [CORRECTED 09:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxury hosiery maker Wolford on Wednesday posted a preliminary group net profit of 190 million schillings for the year ending April 30, compared with 166 (corrects from 176) million schillings the year before.</p>
<p>The company said it planned to raise the dividend to 10 schillings from 7.5 schillings last year. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
